{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫台慶紅地氈向來是女藝人們爭妍鬥麗之戰場，現正就讀大學3年級的新生代小花Emily周智敏今年再度登場。她一改 …</p><p></p>\n<p>無綫台慶紅地氈向來是女藝人們爭妍鬥麗之戰場，現正就讀大學3年級的新生代小花Emily周智敏今年再度登場。她一改以往青春甜美乖乖女形象，以一身極具視覺衝擊力打扮震撼全場。這種破格蛻變背後隱藏著她在演藝路上充滿野心之獨特佈局。</p>\n<h2>周智敏紅髮銀紗戰衣大騷豐滿身材</h2>\n<p>Emily今年於台慶夜現身電視城外景通道時，徹底告別去年青春公主風。她染上一頭搶眼紅棕色大波浪長捲髮，身穿銀白色閃片透視薄紗大裙擺晚裝，心形低胸剪裁搭配裸色透視網紗，大方展示事業線。戰衣設計充滿巧思，高領閃鑽頸圈垂墜著水晶珠串流蘇，雙臂配有飄逸多層次珠串流蘇肩鏈，轉身回眸間盡顯成熟嫵媚女人味。</p>\n<h2>周智敏親自剖白平衡學業與事業心得</h2>\n<p>面對外間對其破格造型高度關注，Emily在後台受訪時大方分享近況。她透露為了參與前輩羅嘉良演出環節及台慶遊戲部分，事前足足排練約2星期。作為大學3年級學生，她坦言修讀演藝相關科目能讓讀書與幕前工作相輔相成，並預計再過1年畢業後便會全力投入演藝圈。她更提及早前獨自前往德國旅行，笑言拍下泳衣照令好姊妹Jenny直呼「流鼻血」。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542323077157498_13015112556b03fbff6c8c0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"918033853_17960403159259339_5378147946307552844_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542323077157498_13015112556b03fbff6c8c0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542323452741643_8204808856b03fc02dc4fc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"emchow816_1795262683_4035278142938868144_64694652193.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542323452741643_8204808856b03fc02dc4fc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542323691919173_13307143916b03fc055bb6b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"emchow816_1795262683_4035278158340516970_64694652193.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542323691919173_13307143916b03fc055bb6b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>保留舊物配襯經典雙C耳環成標記</h2>\n<p>回顧Emily去年紅地氈造型，當時她以一襲香檳金色細肩帶深V心形低胸貼身閃片晚裝示人，搭配清爽高馬尾與蜜桃色妝容，充滿校園少女活力。縱使2年間由青春躍升至冷艷風格，她耳際依然佩戴同一款經典雙C閃鑽吊墜耳環，成為戰衣配搭中一大標誌。她在抽獎環節前亦重提舊事，指去年與名車大獎僅差一個號碼，並祈求今年身處香港能真正贏得座駕。</p>\n<h2>網民對Emily性感大解放評價兩極化</h2>\n<p>這組紅地氈及後台靚相曝光後迅速在各大社交平台引發激烈討論。部分網民對其大膽突破表示讚賞，留言稱「完全睇唔出係大學生」、「紅髮造型超有氣質」。不過亦有部分觀眾認為她年紀尚輕，批評新路線過於成熟，直指「都係鍾意佢以前清純乖乖女多啲」、「着到咁真係有啲唔敢直視」。社交平台上關於她下一年畢業後發展方向討論依然持續不斷。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17954232406287725_1333886556b03fc0919988.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"emchow816_1763806474_3771404476969235761_64694652193.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17954232406287725_1333886556b03fc0919988.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>回顧Emily去年紅地氈造型，當時她以一襲香檳金色細肩帶深V心形低胸貼身閃片晚裝示人（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542324331530729_5082070946b03fc0bc6872.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"emchow816_1763806474_3771404485072636222_64694652193.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542324331530729_5082070946b03fc0bc6872.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542324639871929_10642376256b03fc0ebe120.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"emchow816_1763806474_3771404491380824678_64694652193.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542324639871929_10642376256b03fc0ebe120.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542324831395414_19058932946b03fc10aa1dd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"emchow816_1763806474_3771404461173449975_64694652193.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542324831395414_19058932946b03fc10aa1dd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/tvb%e5%8f%b0%e6%85%b6/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tvb台慶</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%91%a8%e6%99%ba%e6%95%8f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">周智敏</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%b4%85%e5%9c%b0%e6%b0%88/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">紅地氈</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3548739\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 23 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T10:03:55.535214+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1361,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:40:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T10:37:32.678832+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T09:57:25.554970+00:00","content_hash":"013e8c25bc371b78adb082ed0969fc37655bc70cdbb9cf442a8509850c77ae80","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}